{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28238","headline":"听王氏话归州昭君庙 · 李远","name":"听王氏话归州昭君庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献之闲坐说归州，曾到昭君庙里游。\n自古行人多怨恨，至今乡土尽风流。\n泉如珠泪侵阶滴，花似红妆满岸愁。\n河畔犹残翠眉样，有时新月傍帘钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}